# `swegemma` harness. Generated by tools/build_kernel.py: do not edit the copy
# under build/, edit this template.
#
# Runs on a Kaggle GPU session (T4 x2 or L4 x4) with internet off. Inputs:
#   competition  gemma-4-developer-agent
#   dataset      metric/gemma-4-developer-agent-wheelhouse        (official harness wheels)
#   dataset      zbigniewkirchner/gemma-4-agent-local-eval-wheels  (scorer-like sandbox)
#   dataset      zbigniewkirchner/gemma-4-agent-local-eval-pythons
#   model        google/gemma-4/Other/<model>/2
#
# The scorer-like sandbox (sections marked SANDBOX) is adapted from Zbigniew
# Kirchner's public notebook "Gemma 4 Agent: Run Your Agent Locally"
# (kaggle.com/code/zbigniewkirchner/gemma-4-agent-run-your-agent-locally,
# Apache-2.0). Changes: the current task is tracked with a ContextVar and image
# folders are built under a lock, so tasks can run concurrently.
